              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keerei Parao ichek, ak kogaigaigei amu bikyik tugul che chang’ che kigibare rotwetab chok; Parao ak lugennyi komugul, mwaei Kiptaiyat Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
